BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20211023T200000Z
DTEND:20210807T190000Z
SUMMARY:OSArch Monthly Meetup #19: BridgeLink - Open-Source Bridge Engineering Software by Richard Brice from the Washington State Dept. of Transportation
URL:https://meet.jit.si/openbim
DESCRIPTION:This month we are hosting Richard Brice to talk about BridgeLink, an open-source bridge engineer software published by the Washington State Department of Transportation. The flagship application, PGSuper for design, analysis, and load rating of precast, prestressed concrete girder bridges, will be highlighted including recent efforts to support bridge data exchanges with IFC 4x3
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
